86.
Maintenance of account books and other registers.
- The Registrar shall maintain the following books and registers-
(1)
Cashbook;
(2)
Ledger;
(3)
Inward and Outward ledger including postage accounts;
(4)
Dead stock register;
(5)
Stock register for printed certificates;
(6)
Receipt books;
(7)
Register for grants;
Page 19/39

The Maharashtra Medical Council Rules, 1967
(8)
Voucher files;
(9)
Attendance roll;
(10)
Register of leave accounts;
(11)
Registers required for the provident Fund of the Council;
(12)
Service Books; and
(13)
Other registers that may be necessary.
